Why This Market Matters
Pharmaceutical serialization and aggregation solutions provide the digital infrastructure needed to identify, track, and connect pharmaceutical products throughout complex supply chains. Serialization assigns unique identities to individual drug units, while aggregation establishes hierarchical relationships between packages. Together, these technologies support traceability, regulatory compliance, counterfeit prevention, recall management, and supply-chain visibility.

